Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fear, excitement, and thrills-the triple package!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's me, "Pandæmonium"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Pandemonium"? The same name as the prison of fog...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was my name to begin with,\Nbefore they started calling the fog that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Ivory one made the fog, not me.\NSo don't get that mixed up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:32.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I see, so you're simply the Pure Concept of Chaos, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then shall we get this movie started?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sense a bit of the Ivory one in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.17,0:02:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, that hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to close that gate to the\Ndimension of original sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-maa, oh no! You've captured me so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.50,0:02:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, of the Four Major Human Errors I'm the weakest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:02:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'm also known as the worst of the lot:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pandæmonium!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An illusion? No, I can sense they're both real!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez! I can't believe I'd get tripped up so easily.\NI'm so useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know that! I'm me too, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Great work on the warm-up match, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We haven't met in this instance of Time yet,\Nbut let me just say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You always try to keep Menou for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hang in there. Don't die, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You live up to your name as the source of original sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes sense that you used Manon Libelle\Nin an attempt to spread monstrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monstrine is made from your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:26.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By making people ingest a part of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you infested their bodies to use them\Nas sacrifices for your resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Half of that isn't right, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to resurrect myself.\NI just wanted to try doing a movie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Doing... a movie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I love watching movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know, there aren't any movies in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ignore that, so I'm doing one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I want you to be the heroine of this panic film!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:05:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is desperately run\Nto-and-fro away from me, a.k.a. the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly gain\Nfrom doing something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No gain. That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See, humans are fun to watch when\Nthey're trying their absolute best,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,whether they live or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's important is the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Watching people doing their best\Nand dying is so, sooooo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what B movies are all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some sudden calamity happens,\Nthere are heaps of victims,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,occasionally the main character dies,\Nhumanity goes extinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and sometimes it even ends\Nwith the monster winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I think that's the truth, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, isn't reality...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,beyond one's control, just like a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come now, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I oversee the mass of monsters\Ninfesting the eternal world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you say you can stop a monster like me,\Ngo ahead and try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was used as a sacrifice in sin magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I sensed a large, twisted conjuring earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've received word that there are people\Nwho have melted all over the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those who had been taking monstrine, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go quickly and get information on how many.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, how aggravating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A triple invocation of scripture magecraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's very skillful,\Nbut you have pretty mediocre etheric capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're already almost out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that thing is what caused a\Nhundred people to melt away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll act as if we're meeting for the first time, Miss Priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Ashuna Grisarika.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you fighting against?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of the Four Major Human Errors, Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You just mentioned that a hundred\Npeople melted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though we may not have accounted for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That number is probably...\Nthe number of lives that thing has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:56.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So we must kill it a hundred times to defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice and clear-cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps, we may be able to take it out in one blow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...with Your Highness's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, maa! We have a new guest, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But with my hands gone,\NI can't welcome you with a handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see, the worst possible encounter, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? Are you truly up to the task?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can definitely do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead and prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ordinarily, humans cannot use power that\Ngoes beyond their etheric capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She connected the earthen and heavenly veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What impressive etheric control!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! I really do think you're like the Ivory one,\Njust a tiny little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A pseudo-church, huh? Wow, just wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think your efforts are victorious-!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did that do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:11:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I connected the ether of the earthen vein\Nto the heavenly vein in an endless cycle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so this binding force is practically permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In all honesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It helped that there weren't too many sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have managed without Your Highness's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I truly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it. I'm glad I got to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was some amazing magecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is Momo all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were actually supposed to meet last night,\Nto compare what we had accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But she never came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo... was poisoned during an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And? How is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:46.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't say she's doing well, but she should live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For now, she's at the church-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be no fun if you went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.67,0:12:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay here and play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness Princess Ashuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No thanks necessary.\NYou should save your ether for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In any case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The size of that thing is beyond ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's one of my favorites!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's definitely one of the Four Major Human Errors...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed. A true monstrosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, that's awful! A monstrosity?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a cute little monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! Should I introduce myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's stopped... isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm one of Four Major Human Errors,\N{\rSubtitle-2}the Pure Concept of Chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting in my way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because if you go there the movie\Nwill become something different!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After I went through the trouble of summoning that cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, this one's super duper strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because she fortified herself through\Ncannibalism for a looong time in the fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Cannibalism"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this one's just a bit different\Nfrom the ones from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So... are you two ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then if I defeat you here,\Nwill that monster disappear too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! Maa, maa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You, defeat me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I may be weak, but you're even weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You silly, overconfident user of Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if you still don't mind, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see now, right? You're no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That kind of fight scene is just boring in a movie,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then what did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:20.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if I said I wanted to talk with\Nsomeone from my homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,About something nostalgic from Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a Human Error, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must have used your\NPure Concept so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you can't possibly have any memories left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! I'm impressed you know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every time you use a Pure Concept,\Nit erodes your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still want to hear about it, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The things you remember,\Nand your precious memories from Japan-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want my old world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:15:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten a lot already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I remember the feeling that\Nthe world was good for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is a world like that really worth anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh! But of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The world doesn't exist for your sake, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We exist for the sake of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, none of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I just came to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:34.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I was able to escape\Nthat fog all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks... to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose we should start by slicing up this tentacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:58.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, Princess Ashuna. There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Then what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to do anything. Look, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This monster is still sealed within the prison of fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I imagine it's only been summoned temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:15.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! I'm surprised you figured it out, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't bring her out completely just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now the fog has found me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pandemonium...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not the real one, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! What gave me away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Except for that massive one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the monsters you've summoned\Naren't particularly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And just look at the state of your\Nprecious minion over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If a monster that serves you is still trapped in the fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's no way you could have escaped yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The you here... is just a little portion, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm just a finger puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I somehow managed to squeeze just a\Npinky finger out through a gap in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the fog when it got warped,\Nand gave it human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A "gap"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would there be such a\Nthing in the prison of fog?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Miss Priestess, you alone might understand why!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:18.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could it be... it has to do with Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know how you turned back time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On this world,\Nover and over and over and ooover?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard it in the fog, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sound of you regressing time and\Nmaking the world creak under the stress!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what warped the fog too, and made a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I was able to get a pinky out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The stuff happening in this city are\Ntotally aaaall because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish you could warp it even more\Nso that all of me can escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I guess that isn't possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:19:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've lost too much of your memories, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want to stay intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you're at the point where you need to\Nrefrain from using your Pure Concept at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've forgotten\Nso much that your personality
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,isn't what it was like in Japan anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what? I don't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a best friend in this world\NI'd be happy to risk my life for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A friend so precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I lose all my memories\Nas long as I remember her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I care about is getting killed by Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't become like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't become a Human Error!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't mind getting killed by her?\NWhat a beautiful friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:12.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I feel sorry for you.\NYou don't realize you're at a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really believe that there's a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there is! Why wouldn't there be?!\NThat's what this power is for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. You'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because to the people who can\Nconnect to the Astral Archive,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:31.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,your Regression means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Astral... Archive"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:39.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The memories of this planet and what powers ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The origin of the Lord written about\Nin the priestesses' scriptures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way to cheat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even up to this point,\Nit's no accident you kept failing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone used their power to make sure you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Someone"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.79,0:21:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have an idea of who it might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's probably that person who\Nkeeps getting in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So listen, here's something you'll want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It exists. A way back to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This was all caused by Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So now there's yet another reason why\NI have to kill her as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.67,0:21:29.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But for now, I have to defeat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! With the fog surrounding me,\NI guess this body is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It lasted longer than expected, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the next scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The classic ending trope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The big bad uses all its energy to become enormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.29,0:21:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to put all of the sacrifices\NI got in this city towards it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.71,0:22:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come! It's time for the blood-stirring,\Nflesh-splattering climax!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: The Duo's Journey.
