Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.00,Caption-7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,252)}{\an7}Beyond the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.00,Caption-7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,302.4)}{\an7}there was nothing to be found in the plains
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.00,Caption-7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,352.8)}{\an7}below. Morning, afternoon, and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:26.00,Caption-7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,403.2)}{\an7}The exhausted people were at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.63,Caption-12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,244.8)}{\an7}Blam, blam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.63,Caption-12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,295.2)}{\an7}A sound echoed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.63,Caption-12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,345.6)}{\an7}and the people raised their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.63,Caption-12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,396)}{\an7}The woman said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.17,Caption-13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,244.8)}{\an7}Mouth closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.17,Caption-13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,295.2)}{\an7}she raised her hand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.17,Caption-13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,345.6)}{\an7}and struck with a hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.17,Caption-13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,396)}{\an7}All eyes were focused
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.17,Caption-13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,446.4)}{\an7}on the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:27.71,Caption-14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,237.6)}{\an7}In order to do what must be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:27.71,Caption-14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,288)}{\an7}the woman raised her arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:27.71,Caption-14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,338.4)}{\an7}She simply hammered the stake,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:27.71,Caption-14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,388.8)}{\an7}to make known the land where all shall begin.
